Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: consolidate Hamoa ADC nodes

The integration has two adc@9000 nodes and incompatible channel macro APIs.
Keep the complete native-channel node, both labels, thermal cells and IRQ
names. Its existing channel@18e includes the correct prescaling.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/hamoa-pmics.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/hamoa-pmics.dtsi
@@ -3,8 +3,6 @@
